{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqhha58fz9k","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"OVERRIDE: canonical ON-arm must run the REAL eager-judge (LLM) on autowire candidates — not a ceScore threshold, not judge-all-sessions","summary":"Corrects the SDK arms.py canonical wiring (S5, ported from FeatureBench). PRODUCTION pipeline for a task's context edges: autowire seeds candidates (cosine >= SEMANTIC_AUTOWIRE_THRESHOLD 0.55 + cross-encoder rerank top-K) -> the LLM EAGER-JUDGE keeps/prunes each candidate (default prune) -> the task only becomes READY after its edges are judged (the judging-phase quarantine) -> the agent reads the FROZEN, already-judged context_deps. So the edges ARE LLM-judged, BEFORE ready.\n\nThree variants: (a) PRODUCTION = LLM eager-judge over the autowire candidate set. (b) old probe_runner = LLM judges ALL sessions (overshoots / inflation). (c) FeatureBench-ported SDK wiring = ceScore>0.2 THRESHOLD, NO LLM judge (undershoots). The faithful one is (a).\n\nFIX (arms.run_canonical_wiring): mint probe-as-task (post_status not_ready+summary) -> autowire seeds candidates -> drive the REAL eager-judge: GET /judge/next?node=<probe> -> LLM keep/prune via EdgeJudge (judge.py rubric, default prune) -> POST /judge/verdict (keepEdge/pruneEdge) -> read /task/context. Replaces task_suggest+ceScore+overlay_edge. Add client.judge_next (GET /judge/next?node=&budget=).\n\nCONSTRAINT (note-mqh0gwz1mxc + note-mqgwrh5a63x): keepEdge's in-place promotion (weight 0->cosine, judged:true) persists ONLY for the daemon's LIVE state.workspace overlay; for a non-live isolated workspace overlayStore.save() skips the same-signature in-place mutation, so the kept edge is NOT persisted and won't surface in /task/context. Therefore each conversation must run as the embedded bench daemon's LIVE workspace (one daemon.py instance per conversation with state.workspace=that conv dir, or re-point ORCH_WORKSPACE per conversation) — NOT a passed isolated ?workspace= on a shared daemon. (That persistence gap is exactly why probe_runner used createEdge/upsert — but createEdge force-asserts edges, bypassing the autowire-candidate judging = the inflation we're removing.) Faithful = autowire candidates + eager-judge keepEdge + L","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-17T02:55:02.655Z","vec":[-0.05152865871787071,-0.0019446458900347352,-0.0443599708378315,0.005307643208652735,0.04884527251124382,-0.030618982389569283,0.0249194148927927,0.036806683987379074,-0.04537482187151909,0.02748032659292221,0.01932966709136963,-0.04635145142674446,0.04297089949250221,-0.05541105940937996,-0.011045262217521667,0.04223490133881569,0.12163085490465164,-0.045122288167476654,-0.03754723444581032,-0.034347932785749435,0.033956896513700485,0.007889208383858204,0.051246218383312225,0.010304992087185383,-0.0289240013808012,-0.04792085289955139,-0.08614088594913483,-0.012282087467610836,-0.0055092680267989635,-0.03784191235899925,0.013917716220021248,0.09655524045228958,-0.05678404122591019,0.017940588295459747,0.04937741905450821,0.05531609058380127,-0.08942956477403641,-0.025859832763671875,-0.07780918478965759,-0.042834073305130005,0.031087277457118034,0.04358510673046112,-0.0681779533624649,-0.012101818807423115,0.004011720418930054,-0.026733295992016792,-0.11784374713897705,-0.019810818135738373,-0.03611356392502785,-0.03460037708282471,-0.039413467049598694,0.007632714230567217,0.03685901686549187,0.08576367795467377,0.062438204884529114,0.09627002477645874,0.04850438982248306,0.04611211270093918,-0.04085978493094444,-0.014226674102246761,0.00944029912352562,-0.04858027771115303,-0.04387505352497101,-0.04780595377087593,0.007488604635000229,0.05400465428829193,0.005149091128259897,0.025127708911895752,0.0836423709988594,0.014199040830135345,0.018204795196652412,0.007299142424017191,-0.04347384348511696,-0.03768451511859894,0.012001857161521912,0.037096284329891205,0.0638435035943985,0.03364839404821396,0.002065730979666114,-0.09942317754030228,-0.1097899004817009,-0.04046